{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"heading_align":"text-center"}},"rich_text_MacfU4":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_irajCC":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Calibrate your breathalyser with Andatech","heading_size":"h2","heading_h1":true}},"text_wxnw7f":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Regular calibration is important to maintain the accuracy of your breathalyser over time. Andatech recommends calibration every 12 months, or sooner if the usage is particularly high. You can book a one-off calibration using the button below, or select a calibration management plan that suits your device and needs.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"button_jVhjTx":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_1_label":"Book a one-off calibration","button_1_link":"https:\/\/andatech.caltrace.com\/login","button_1_style":"btn--secondary","button_2_label":"","button_2_link":"","button_2_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["heading_irajCC","text_wxnw7f","button_jVhjTx"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"wide":false,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"featured_collection_DxeXC9":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"Featured collection","settings":{"title":"Explore calibration plans","heading_align":"text-center","show_view_all":false,"collection":"breathalyser-calibrations","layout":"grid","card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"large","products_to_show":4,"show_highlight_products":true,"show_promo_info":false,"image_ratio":"fill","promo_title":"A headline to grab attention","content":"<p>Use this card with an image to highlight your collections or introduce a promotion.<\/p>","link_url":"","button_label":"Button","color_scheme":"2","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}},"media_with_text_iHbYNE":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"heading_3CGJEV":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Breathalyser calibration management plans","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"text_8bf9Xy":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A calibration management plan saves you stress, time, and money while ensuring your device's accuracy. <\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"button_pmHReC":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"See plan options","button_link":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/collections\/breathalyser-calibrations","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["heading_3CGJEV","text_8bf9Xy","button_pmHReC"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/calibration-management-handheld.jpg","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"left","image_fit":"contain","media_width":50,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"1","only_content_color_scheme":false}},"multi_column_dT7rXU":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"column_FjU7MW":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/The_Andatech_Prodigy_3_in_action.jpg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Ensure accuracy","text":"<p>Andatech's breathalysers use fuel cell censors which provide optimal accuracy. Over time, fuel cell censors can deviate. Regular calibration ensures your device is accurate so you can make informed decisions.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"column_DrE3PQ":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Andatech_Lifetime_Guarantee_banner.webp","media_scale":100,"heading":"Extend your warranty","text":"<p>Andatech products are built to last and with reliability in mind. Andatech breathalysers that are regularly calibrated receive extended warranties. By continuing to calibrate on schedule, you can benefit from the <a href=\"\/pages\/guarantee\" title=\"Andatech Guarantee\">Andatech Guarantee<\/a>. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"column_GJFKzH":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Andatech_Office_Vermont.jpg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Overall peace of mind","text":"<p>Calibration is handled in our Melbourne-based, NATA-accredited laboratory. Our facility has been certified as meeting international standards for highly accurate calibration, and is one of few such laboratories in Australia.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["column_FjU7MW","column_DrE3PQ","column_GJFKzH"],"custom_css":["h2 {margin-top: 2%; margin-bottom: 2%;}"],"settings":{"title":"Why does calibration matter?","heading_align":"text-center","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"carousel","column_size":"medium","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-center","image_ratio":"1.77","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"link"}},"media_with_text_XwMe3C":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"heading_tGbbGt":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Andatech Lifetime Guarantee","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"text_LdC3Li":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Andatech products are built to last and with reliability in mind. Any Andatech breathalyser that is calibrated per the recommended schedule is supported by Andatech's Lifetime Guarantee.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"button_drMjeE":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"More on Lifetime Guarantee","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/guarantee","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["heading_tGbbGt","text_LdC3Li","button_drMjeE"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["img {max-width: 400px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto;}","div {padding-top: 2%; padding-bottom: 2%;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/andatech_breathalysers_lifetime_guarantee.png","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"left","image_fit":"contain","media_width":40,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"1","only_content_color_scheme":false}},"media_grid_dYhcYU":{"type":"media-grid","blocks":{"media_JiiMXh":{"type":"media","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Andatech_breathalyser_calibration.jpg","link_url":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/resources\/breathalyser-calibration","columns":2,"rows":2,"subheading":"","title":"<p>What is breathalyser calibration and how is it done?<\/p>","heading_size":"h4","button_label":"Read full article","button_link":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/resources\/breathalyser-calibration","overlay_position":"justify-start items-end","text_alignment":"text-start","button_style":"link","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":25}},"media_ffA8bG":{"type":"media","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/menu-calibration_18c92583-bf36-42bf-a816-7d2ca534d7d3.jpg","link_url":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/breathalyser-calibration-faqs-your-questions-answered","columns":1,"rows":1,"subheading":"","title":"<p>Breathalyser calibration FAQs: Your questions answered<\/p>","heading_size":"h5","button_label":"Read full article","button_link":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/breathalyser-calibration-faqs-your-questions-answered","overlay_position":"justify-start items-end","text_alignment":"text-start","button_style":"link","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":35}},"media_KrV9Ta":{"type":"media","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CalibrationBooking5.jpg","link_url":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/about-andatech-calibration-management","columns":1,"rows":1,"subheading":"","title":"<p>All you need to know about Andatech calibration management plan<\/p>","heading_size":"h5","button_label":"Read full article","button_link":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/about-andatech-calibration-management","overlay_position":"justify-start items-end","text_alignment":"text-start","button_style":"link","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":25}},"media_BagUBf":{"type":"media","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Andatech_Office_Vermont.jpg","link_url":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/nata-accredited-breathalyser-calibration-centres","columns":2,"rows":1,"subheading":"","title":"<p>NATA accredited breathalyser calibration centres in Australia<\/p>","heading_size":"h4","button_label":"Read full article","button_link":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/nata-accredited-breathalyser-calibration-centres","overlay_position":"justify-start items-end","text_alignment":"text-start","button_style":"link","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":25}}},"block_order":["media_JiiMXh","media_ffA8bG","media_KrV9Ta","media_BagUBf"],"custom_css":["h2 {margin-top: 2%; margin-bottom: 2%;}"],"settings":{"title":"Make informed safety decisions","heading_align":"text-center","button_label":"","button_link":"","gallery_cols_max":4,"mobile_carousel":false,"gallery_cols_min":"1","fixed_height_desktop":180,"fixed_height_mobile":300,"section_color_scheme":"none","color_scheme":"white","transparent_content_color":"#ffffff"}},"faq_f6kJXr":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_CTebrU":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How often should I calibrate my breathalyser?","text":"<p>You are recommended to calibrate your breathalyser every 6 months regardless of the number of uses. This maintains its accuracy and prolong its lifespan. Additionally, regular calibration can extend the warranty of your breathalyser under the <a href=\"https:\/\/apps.pagefly.io\/pages\/guarantee\" target=\"_blank\">Andatech Guarantee<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"question_rTxQpW":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can I book a one-off calibration?","text":"<p>Yes, you can manually book your breathalyser calibration on <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.caltrace.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Caltrace<\/a>. However, we highly recommend that you check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/apps.pagefly.io\/pages\/breathalyser-calibration\" target=\"_blank\">calibration management plans<\/a> that can save you time and money compared to regular calibrations.<\/p>"}},"question_XFgL67":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the calibration process?","text":"<ol><li>Pack your breathalyser securely in a padded parcel bag or box after removing all its accessories.<\/li><li>Print and attach the return label that you received through email. <\/li><li>Drop your breathalyser off over an Australia Post counter and get a lodgement receipt.<\/li><li>Wait for your breathalyser to be calibrated and mailed back to you.<\/li><\/ol>"}},"question_PxbWxa":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Do I get an extended guarantee if I have my breathalyser calibrated regularly?","text":"<p>Yes! Your Andatech breathalyser is entitled to the Andatech Guarantee if calibrated every 6 months.<\/p><p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/guarantee?__hstc=135743086.69b765a69fc43411c7e53b13b8face21.1713766343200.1713766343200.1713766343200.1&__hssc=135743086.1.1713766343200&__hsfp=641231129\" target=\"_blank\">Andatech Guarantee<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"question_XMkHnm":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Is breathalyser usage training available?","text":"<p>Yes! We provide online training for <a href=\"https:\/\/apps.pagefly.io\/products\/online-training-for-andatech-surety\" target=\"_self\">Andatech Surety<\/a>,<a href=\"https:\/\/apps.pagefly.io\/products\/online-training-for-andatech-prodigy-s\" target=\"_self\">Prodigy S<\/a>, and<a href=\"https:\/\/apps.pagefly.io\/products\/online-training-for-andatech-precision-plus\" target=\"_self\"> Precision+<\/a>. If you have questions on using other breathalysers, please contact our Support team at 1300 800 200.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_CTebrU","question_rTxQpW","question_XFgL67","question_PxbWxa","question_XMkHnm"],"settings":{"heading":"Calibration FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"1","full_width":false}}},"order":["main","rich_text_MacfU4","featured_collection_DxeXC9","media_with_text_iHbYNE","multi_column_dT7rXU","media_with_text_XwMe3C","media_grid_dYhcYU","faq_f6kJXr"]}